    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n111461" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φῐλορώμαιος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a friend to the Romans</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				804.12
			</span></i> (Cos, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IPE</u>
				2.34.8
			</span></i> (Panticapaeum, <span class="entity">iii A. D.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				14.2.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				21
			</span></i>, etc. The accent <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλορωμαῖος,</span> found in <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				396.45
			</span></i>, etc., is condemned by Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.133
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φιλορρώμαιος</span> occurs as
				v. l. in codd.).</div>
